        "created_at": "2018-10-04T15:02:29.986Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Rosa_Parks_Kelmalu\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"111093\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/rosa_parks_kelmalu/48/99981_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rosa_Parks_Kelmalu:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>But a rather open access would be nice to all of us</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Basically you want a free neural network. Instead of asking other people to make this for you, why not make your own?</p>",
