        "created_at": "2018-10-04T16:31:23.641Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am not saying I am not willing to put resources on it, IRL and ingame, but I wanted to know what people already did. And no, I do no want someone to train my network, but this is not a simple thing and not only about fielding a bunch of 1080 GTX cards.</p>",
