      {
        "id": 707209,
        "name": "Fannie Anathema",
        "username": "Fannie_Anathema",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/fannie_anathema/{size}/216198_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-10-23T20:03:53.527Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Having done this for a while and having worked in sports betting and finance, I’d recommend you take a stab at sports betting, where AI does produce some good results. EvE markets aren’t efficient or volatile enough to be worth it.</p>\n<p>At best, with AI, you could try to flag market manipulation attempts. But that’s not a whole lot of money compared to being able to value items correctly, which AI doesn’t help you with.</p>",
